          <rules>
            <rule name="Malevolent Artifice" id="c488-ac28-c303-57b" hidden="false" page="4" publicationId="8775-88f5-cfdd-24f6">
              <description>Models with this special rule may re-roll all failed Armour Saves taken against any Wounds resolved at a Strength value lower than their Toughness Characteristic. This special rule has no effect on Cover Saves or Invulnerable Saves.</description>
